This repository distributes a derivative checkpoint based on:

- nvidia/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVFP4
- Inferact/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVFP4 (NVFP4 MTP expert donor only)

The derivative converts selected dense side-layer weights to blockwise FP8
E4M3 and replaces the NVIDIA FP8 MTP routed experts with the pinned Inferact
NVFP4 MTP routed experts. No fine-tuning was performed.

The integration code derives from blazux/qwen3.8-Flash-DGX and retains its MIT
license and contributor notices. Model weights remain subject to the NVIDIA
Open Model License and applicable Qwen Community License terms.
